  "next": "Four unique unresolved roots plus one repeat have seven width-9\u201312 leaves with no remaining failed single assumption in 598 complete probes and no unit, component split, binary forcing/conflict or equivalence. Test stronger joint binary consequences in the current pipeline against bounded width/ordering/conditioning controls. For cost, prioritize validated normalization/intermediate reuse in discovery and cold replay.",
  "outcome": "Selective capped-probe continuation certifies 105/110 versus 97/110 base and 103/110 eager. All four exposed misses close; new unique coverage 17/24 to 20/24 and repeats 2/4 to 3/4; no base verdict lost.",
