  },
  "pattern": "One charged bucket gate selects capped nonconstant unresolved residuals for another probe block. Exact unchanged-source cursors reuse a clear prefix and occurrence index; source changes invalidate them. Only checked failed traces, unit restriction and inverse maps enter cold authority.",
  "recognition": "Base/eager translate exactly to the parent at allowances 128/256. Selective restart/resume certificates are identical modulo mode. Eager and selective differ in consequence-batch and relation-tail ordering; the reuse ablation does not claim their coverage difference.",
  "resources": "Depth two gives at most seven edges and 1792 budgeted probes per root; restart may repeat up to 896 additional clear probes. Eight accepted rounds shared. Binary/unit/bucket work and gate/index preparation, failed acquisition, verification, persistence and replay charged separately. No propagation-operation, wall-time or arbitrary-SAT bound.",
